# Flash path

Before changing write/unlock/verify/Go/FCMD code, read `.cursor/skills/sam4l-samba-flash/SKILL.md`.

- Drive `SambaFlashApplet` (official SAM-BA 2.16 `.bin`). Do not issue host FCMD.
- Never write below `0x4000`. Never Erase All.
- Never add Atmel SAM-BA `*.c` / `*.h` to the repo.
